## When Generating Code
- Use React Server Components where possible
- Use 'use client' directive only when needed (state, effects, browser APIs)
- Prefer async/await over .then() chains
- Use the circuit breaker pattern for external API calls
- Follow the existing error handling patterns
- Keep security in mind — validate inputs, sanitize outputs

## Models Available
Use lib/models.ts as the source of truth for available AI models.
Do NOT hardcode model IDs — always reference the registry.
